units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 5
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal
minimize 0.0001 1e-06 100 1000
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 100 iso 1 1 1000
timestep 0.001
run 220000
